        <button type="button" class="act-btn" data-act="drink"><kbd>2</kbd>喝水</button>
        <button type="button" class="act-btn" data-act="photo"><kbd>3</kbd>拍照</button>
      </div>
      <button id="btn-interact" type="button">互動</button>
      <p id="hints">方向鍵／WASD 移動　·　點地面走過去　·　拖曳看周圍　·　E／空白鍵 互動</p>
    </div>

