      </div>
      <div class="card-foot" id="card-foot" hidden>
        <button type="button" class="btn btn-primary" id="card-next">繼續前進</button>
      </div>
    </section>

    <section id="start-screen" class="screen">
      <div class="start-card">
        <p class="start-kicker">一趟走得完、也學得會的山徑</p>
        <h1>數位登山</h1>
        <p class="start-sub">從登山口走到山頂再平安下山。<br>路上的每個選擇，都決定這趟路有多安全。</p>
        <div class="start-btns">
          <button type="button" class="btn btn-primary btn-big" id="btn-start" disabled>整理背包中…</button>
          <button type="button" class="btn" id="btn-howto">操作說明</button>
          <button type="button" class="btn" id="btn-records">查看成就／最佳紀錄</button>
        </div>
        <div class="load-notice" id="load-notice" role="alert" hidden>
          <p id="load-notice-text"></p>
          <button type="button" class="btn btn-small" id="btn-retry">重新讀取題庫</button>
        </div>
        <button class="icon-btn start-sound" id="btn-sound-start" type="button" aria-pressed="false" aria-label="開啟音效" title="開啟音效"></button>
      </div>
    </section>

    <section id="ending-screen" class="screen" hidden>
      <div class="ending-panel">
        <div class="ending-left">
          <canvas id="ending-art" aria-hidden="true"></canvas>
